## Advance, revisit, pause, and escalate

Advance after teach commits two distinct qualifying full passes; initial acquisition and delayed retention remain separate observations. After one failure, score, explain the named repair and use another unused item. After two unsuccessful independent attempts, pause repeated quizzing and revisit the explanation or diagnostic dependency. Source conflict stops the affected lesson and goes to ingest with the exact note heading. Missing or ambiguous keys, unsupported alternatives and an exhausted bank go to plan as plan_issue with 2026_2027/Winter_Semester/Econometrics_II, O010, revision1/O010-C1, P003/V002/ingestion2 and the exact item ID. Closing a partial session does not fabricate acquisition.

